“Exactly.” Lucy smiled, unaware of Christopher’s disapproving look—the one that Anna had noticed and was agonizing over. “Daniel attended Westminster himself. He should tell you some of his adventures. He could suggest the best place to hide your snacks and tricks for cheating without getting caught. I could ask him to come with me here one afternoon if you’d like.”

