put it back on. “I’ll go, but on two conditions,” he said clearly. “The ﬁrst is that you must not criticize my methods, not even when you don’t like them. Maybe for you this absurd plan is a way to distract me from killing DeMercy, but you’ve ended up in a mess that not even you can imagine, and if you want to get yourself out of it, this is the right time.”
